<title>FRANCE: French capacity use seen steady in Q4 - survey.</title>
<headline>French capacity use seen steady in Q4 - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French capacity utilisation is expected to remain unchanged in the fourth quarter of 1996, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly survey of business leaders.</p>
<p>It gave the following data on capacity utilisation rates (in percentages) broken down by sector:</p>
<p>				     1996			1995</p>
<p>			    Oct  July Apr   Jan   Oct  Jul  Apr   Jan</p>
<p> Industry overall     82.7 82.7 83.8  83.6  84.2 84.8 84.8  84.2</p>
<p> Manufacturing	  82.3 82.4 83.6  83.5  84.2 84.4 84.6  84.3</p>
<p> Agri-business	  80.9 80.7 79.9  79.9  81.9 82.2 80.8  81.1</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods  85.0 85.5 85.5  85.1  86.0 88.4 87.7  86.8</p>
<p> Capital goods	  81.5 82.1 82.3  82.4  84.1 81.2 82.5  82.0</p>
<p> Cars, land transport 80.5 80.6 87.0  85.7  84.3 84.7 86.1  87.8</p>
<p> Consumer goods	 81.2 80.4 80.7  81.3  82.2 82.9 82.5  81.7</p>
<p> Energy		   93.6 93.7 99.7  96.4  90.6 100  99.7  92.5</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5071</p>
</text>
